msgstr "![Salida de la celda de código anterior](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-quantum-computing/quantum-simulation/extracted-outputs/9c0f4b39-801a-448c-9dce-8a6d7c83fe76-1.avif)\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "3. Exercise 1. Perform simulation using second-order Suzuki–Trotter {#3-exercise-1-perform-simulation-using-second-order-suzukitrotter}"
